QDjP_Iw&oe=699D8CB1"}, {"file_name": "Untitled (17).png", "id": "950882653694844", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391883_950882657028177_7557776886169499771_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=sE9tsmlcQ3EQ7kNvwHP1uoe&_nc_oc=AdlJIAJZYFYua2kb42LAd2g64i5M51rd8hyIvKGa0g7kJZmeyjbC52ci8cQu5nXZjBw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AftS2jbpCqMmLyiacSxRnOpVif78csaeGYzbaz9A75gOpw&oe=699DA17C"}, {"file_name": "Gravity Sketch_Max Shoe in VR.png", "id": "604412098957797", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473392309_604412102291130_1973578855637505939_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=CgOLvQcfdLIQ7kNvwExbdTJ&_nc_oc=AdmiurtiH6e-AZ3KPL9W5uxX-ZP2Y2_NWBySLX-pLkGglng-7IIEigLCjW_PJnGBG2g&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AftK2L9-gsUVl_Zpp6LNBizQVbsKGpvrJc_zEwUZDs-VXA&oe=699D8660"}, {"file_name": "Untitled (18).png", "id": "9575586179171676", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473392019_9575586185838342_6621453824001345953_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=rJUKxsJLfWkQ7kNvwE4tGfG&_nc_oc=AdkZn_Ok5FmsPwBWxSmK3ZQTTg7v1ns0A_QwtLwprHuUnwyT9HOj_4LvQg-xwHgHq0w&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AftU5ORjriBm9hLuJ-298wjfRWN8WTukC0ESOLCWnPqf6Q&oe=699DA87B"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Store Cover Ideas - Ethan (3) (1).png", "id": "1002616405286649", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491820891_1002616411953315_7907952337098446691_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=c2w4P-8WTRkQ7kNvwH-cAjY&_nc_oc=AdlJPyjmlueuegqb3BnBnRWglIsG5grPfMDHsbsH_Aq07JKxzOXvohtB8H8WrlcaT40&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfvcxuX-Qew1Op_MgQM1oRd5avLM3AH6yVqGLsEcfg4SCg&oe=699D998A"}, "display_name": "Gravity Sketch", "keywords": ["3D", "Sketch", "Collaboration", "Modeling", "Design"], "long_description": "With Gravity Sketch you can create the way you think, in 3D, and dive into your ideas head first. It provides an intuitive, immersive, and powerful space to bring your ideas to life.\n\nEver wonder what your creation would look and feel like in true size? Experience and share your creations immersively; walk around designs at scale, shape them with hand gestures, and invite others to create alongside you in real-time. With the freedom of 3D space, collaboration feels as natural and enjoyable as being together in a studio.\n\nCreate together and see where your imagination takes you.\n\n{1653339911933481}\n\n**Key features**\n\n- Explore a library of 3D community designs that can be accessed in VR\n- Gesturally create detailed 3D sketches and surfaces in free space \n- Experience work at any scale and in AR\n- Intuitively apply textures and materials \n- Use posable mannequins to better understand creations in context\n- Import images and 3D files for reference in IGES, OBJ, FBX, PNG, JPEG, MP4 formats\n- Present designs remotely with collaborators joining from VR or screen\n- Export designs ready for use in downstream tools like Blender\n\n{1127214518949484}\n\nYou\u2019ll be joining a community of professional teams, individuals and hobbyists who use Gravity Sketch to bridge the gap between 2D ideas and 3D reality. \n\n**Learn more at gravitysketch.com**\n\n**Get help:** support@gravitysketch.com\n\n**General inquiries:** hello@gravitysketch.com\n\n**Image credits:** Sneaker sketch by Redd Smith; Shoe being reviewed by Khamis Studio; Park Scene by Nicholas Baker; Glasses by Achilles Design;", "short_description": "With Gravity Sketch you can create the way you think, in 3D, and dive into your ideas head first. Bring your ideas to life in an intuitive, immersive, multiplayer 3D environment."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.gravitysketch.com/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://www.gravitysketch.com/eula/", "publisher_name": "Gravity Sketch", "support_w